## <Fa class="inline" icon={faApple} /> MacOS

### Homebrew🍻

Pyro Music can be installed through Homebrew. We host our own cask definition thus you'll need to add our tap first:

```bash
$ brew tap krtirtho/apps
$ brew install --cask pyro_music
```

